No change needed. `tests/calc/steps/state.go` already declares `type State struct{ Result int }`, and the existing `then` definition in `tests/calc/steps/definitions.go` reads `state.Result` to compare it with the expected value. The `when` body writes that same field, so the observation side needs no edit.

